{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39760382",
      "title": "Lifting State Up",
      "sourceHash": "00382fb2da0131fe7f87ddf686f99250d32e8d1dfe3085daf28166a8a0b06d35",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.81,
          "end": 2.73,
          "en": "So now that we're gathering",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.73,
          "end": 7.17,
          "en": "and storing user input, it's time to use that input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.17,
          "end": 9.66,
          "en": "with that utility function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.66,
          "end": 12.33,
          "en": "you find in the investment.js file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.33,
          "end": 15.87,
          "en": "this calculateInvestmentResults function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.87,
          "end": 18.33,
          "en": "to calculate the results we want to show",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.33,
          "end": 20.91,
          "en": "in that table in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.91,
          "end": 22.77,
          "en": "Now therefore, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.77,
          "end": 26.97,
          "en": "we have to answer the question, where this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.97,
          "end": 31.2,
          "en": "should be used, where should those results be calculated?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.2,
          "end": 32.793,
          "en": "Where do we need them?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.75,
          "end": 36.87,
          "en": "And of course, we could calculate those results",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.87,
          "end": 39.24,
          "en": "in the userInput component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.24,
          "end": 43.86,
          "en": "There we got this userInput object, which conveniently",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.86,
          "end": 48.06,
          "en": "and not by accident has exactly the shape we need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.06,
          "end": 52.92,
          "en": "as an input for this calculateInvestmentResults function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.92,
          "end": 55.65,
          "en": "because there we also expect to get an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.65,
          "end": 59.37,
          "en": "as an input which has these four properties,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 59.37,
          "end": 62.76,
          "en": "which are the four properties I have here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 62.76,
          "end": 66.36,
          "en": "Though if you went for individual state slices,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 66.36,
          "end": 68.82,
          "en": "you can of course also simply combine them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 68.82,
          "end": 72.24,
          "en": "into such an object by deriving this object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 72.24,
          "end": 74.55,
          "en": "based on your state slices.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 74.55,
          "end": 78.51,
          "en": "But either way, we could therefore use this function here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 78.51,
          "end": 83.22,
          "en": "in the userInput component and calculate our results here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 83.22,
          "end": 87.03,
          "en": "But do we need those results in this component?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 87.03,
          "end": 90.66,
          "en": "The answer to this question, probably, is no",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 90.66,
          "end": 93.47999999999999,
          "en": "because even though we don't have it yet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 93.47999999999999,
          "end": 96.96000000000001,
          "en": "I do of course plan to add a separate component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 96.96000000000001,
          "end": 100.25999999999999,
          "en": "for outputting that results table.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 100.25999999999999,
          "end": 103.17,
          "en": "And that table should then be shown",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 103.17,
          "end": 105.393,
          "en": "below the userInput component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 108.3,
          "end": 112.44,
          "en": "So therefore, since I plan to output the results here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 112.44,
          "end": 117.03,
          "en": "in a dedicated component we'll need to get our user input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 117.03,
          "end": 120.48,
          "en": "from the userInput component to the App component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 120.48,
          "end": 123.87,
          "en": "so that in here we can calculate those results",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 123.87,
          "end": 127.62,
          "en": "and pass those results to the Results component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 127.62,
          "end": 131.34,
          "en": "Or pass the user input to the Results component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 131.34,
          "end": 133.77,
          "en": "and calculate the results in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 133.77,
          "end": 137.1,
          "en": "And that's therefore indeed what I will do here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 137.1,
          "end": 142.1,
          "en": "I'll add a new component, Results.jsx is my file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 143.01,
          "end": 146.79,
          "en": "and in there I'll have this function component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 146.79,
          "end": 148.743,
          "en": "which I'll name Results.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 150.27,
          "end": 153.57,
          "en": "And my goal is to get the user input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 153.57,
          "end": 156.81,
          "en": "as an input in this component here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 156.81,
          "end": 160.14,
          "en": "so as props in this Results component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 160.14,
          "end": 163.41,
          "en": "So that in this Results component I can calculate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 163.41,
          "end": 167.493,
          "en": "that results data and output that results table.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 168.75,
          "end": 172.89,
          "en": "For the moment I'll just return a placeholder here, Results,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 172.89,
          "end": 174.84300000000002,
          "en": "which will be replaced later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 176.31,
          "end": 178.74,
          "en": "And I'll start by getting the user input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 178.74,
          "end": 182.16,
          "en": "from the userInput component to the App component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 182.16,
          "end": 184.35,
          "en": "so that then we can pass it back down",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 184.35,
          "end": 187.833,
          "en": "to the Results component which we will soon use here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 188.94,
          "end": 191.52,
          "en": "And therefore what we can do here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 191.52,
          "end": 195.27,
          "en": "is we can simply lift this state up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 195.27,
          "end": 198.813,
          "en": "from the userInput component to the App component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 199.65,
          "end": 201.85,
          "en": "We can cut this state here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 203.07,
          "end": 207.22,
          "en": "and add it in the App component function like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 209.22,
          "end": 213.48,
          "en": "and then import useState in this file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 213.48,
          "end": 216,
          "en": "since we're now using this function here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 216,
          "end": 217.503,
          "en": "in this App component file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 219.45,
          "end": 222.09,
          "en": "and we'll, of course, also need to lift",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 222.09,
          "end": 224.97,
          "en": "this handleChange function up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 224.97,
          "end": 228.06,
          "en": "So cut it from userInput component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 228.06,
          "end": 231.213,
          "en": "and move it into the App component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 234.12,
          "end": 237.48,
          "en": "And now with that, we should add a new prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 237.48,
          "end": 239.46,
          "en": "to the userInput component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 239.46,
          "end": 243,
          "en": "so that we can call this handleChange function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 243,
          "end": 246.09,
          "en": "from inside the userInput component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 246.09,
          "end": 249.87,
          "en": "So we need to pass a pointer to this handleChange function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 249.87,
          "end": 252.573,
          "en": "as a value to the userInput component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 253.8,
          "end": 255.51,
          "en": "And hence I'll add a prop here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 255.51,
          "end": 259.53,
          "en": "which I'll name onChange or onChangeInput,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 259.53,
          "end": 262.53,
          "en": "the name is up to you because it's your component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 262.53,
          "end": 264.13,
          "en": "Here I'll go for a onChange",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 265.8,
          "end": 269.46,
          "en": "and I'll point at handleChange here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 269.46,
          "end": 274.46,
          "en": "So that this function is passed as a value to userInput.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 275.37,
          "end": 278.28,
          "en": "And as you learned you don't call the function here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 278.28,
          "end": 279.84000000000003,
          "en": "you don't add parentheses,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 279.84000000000003,
          "end": 282.39300000000003,
          "en": "instead you just use it as a value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 283.5,
          "end": 286.68,
          "en": "And with that, in the userInput component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 286.68,
          "end": 290.73,
          "en": "we can accept this prop and destructure it here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 290.73,
          "end": 293.76,
          "en": "the onChange prop which I just added,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 293.76,
          "end": 295.17,
          "en": "and get rid of this import",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 295.17,
          "end": 297.993,
          "en": "since we're not managing state in here anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 299.15999999999997,
          "end": 302.82,
          "en": "And now this onChange prop here will hold a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 302.82,
          "end": 306.423,
          "en": "because we're passing a function as a value to onChange.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 307.44,
          "end": 311.64,
          "en": "And hence we can call onChange as a function in here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 311.64,
          "end": 314.1,
          "en": "And therefore in this anonymous function here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 314.1,
          "end": 317.49,
          "en": "where we previously called handleChange,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 317.49,
          "end": 319.053,
          "en": "I'll now call onChange,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 319.89,
          "end": 322.41,
          "en": "which is the same function in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 322.41,
          "end": 324.96,
          "en": "now just received through a prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 324.96,
          "end": 328.53,
          "en": "And I'll do this for all those inputs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 328.53,
          "end": 333.09000000000003,
          "en": "calling onChange to, in the end, pass this data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 333.09000000000003,
          "end": 337.503,
          "en": "to the App component and there to the handleChange function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 338.88,
          "end": 341.55,
          "en": "But, of course, in the userInput component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 341.55,
          "end": 344.67,
          "en": "we also need that user input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 344.67,
          "end": 348.72,
          "en": "We need that userInput object to update the values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 348.72,
          "end": 350.73,
          "en": "of these input fields.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 350.73,
          "end": 353.07,
          "en": "And therefore, of course, we should also accept",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 353.07,
          "end": 357.271,
          "en": "a second prop here, maybe named userInput",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 357.271,
          "end": 359.55,
          "en": "so that we don't have to make any changes down there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 359.55,
          "end": 361.08,
          "en": "in the JSX code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 361.08,
          "end": 363.72,
          "en": "And this should now be a prop that should get",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 363.72,
          "end": 366.483,
          "en": "this userInput object as a value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 367.53,
          "end": 369.78,
          "en": "Therefore, back in the App component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 369.78,
          "end": 373.48,
          "en": "we now also must set this userInput prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 374.73,
          "end": 377.25,
          "en": "on the userInput component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 377.25,
          "end": 382.11,
          "en": "and set this equal to this userInput state here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 382.11,
          "end": 386.04,
          "en": "so that it's this object that's passed as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 386.04,
          "end": 389.88,
          "en": "for that userInput prop to the userInput component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 389.88,
          "end": 392.25,
          "en": "And I know that's a lot of userInputs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 392.25,
          "end": 394.8,
          "en": "we could of course all choose a different name here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 394.8,
          "end": 398.52,
          "en": "for the prop and also for the state if you wanted to,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 398.52,
          "end": 401.46,
          "en": "you can rename all these things.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 401.46,
          "end": 405.81,
          "en": "But with that, we now lifted this userInput state here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 405.81,
          "end": 409.8,
          "en": "up from the userInput component to the App component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 409.8,
          "end": 411.96,
          "en": "And we're doing this so that we can",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 411.96,
          "end": 416.40999999999997,
          "en": "now also pass this user input to the Results component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 417.42,
          "end": 421.05,
          "en": "so that in there we also get a prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 421.05,
          "end": 424.29,
          "en": "and here I'm again using prop destructuring to store it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 424.29,
          "end": 426.99,
          "en": "at prop in a separate variable,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 426.99,
          "end": 430.05,
          "en": "and here we can also name it userInput,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 430.05,
          "end": 433.68,
          "en": "or just input to mix things up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 433.68,
          "end": 435.69,
          "en": "And then in here for the moment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 435.69,
          "end": 438.123,
          "en": "I'll just console.log input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 440.76,
          "end": 443.22,
          "en": "And with that, back in the App component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 443.22,
          "end": 445.23,
          "en": "below the userInput component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 445.23,
          "end": 449.34,
          "en": "I now do want to output that Results component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 449.34,
          "end": 452.61,
          "en": "And for that, of course, you must import Results",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 452.61,
          "end": 455.133,
          "en": "from this Results.jsx file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 457.5,
          "end": 459.72,
          "en": "And then on this Results component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 459.72,
